# Everything in artifacts/ and results/ is regenerable by `python run_all.py`,
# but the trained distinguishers and the verified approximation tables are kept
# in the repository on purpose: they are small (a few tens of KB each) and they
# are what makes the reported numbers exactly reproducible rather than merely
# re-derivable.  Only the scratch logs are excluded.
